  "description": "The Xenon Expert XL takes performance up another level with a comprehensive component upgrade designed for riders demanding even more from their race bike. As part of the Xenon range, it features a disc-ready frame and fork, allowing for a seamless upgrade to a full disc brake setup using our aftermarket conversion kit.\nNo detail has been overlooked, with forged disc-ready dropouts featuring integrated chain tensioners, Tioga Power Block tires, and Clipper Expert rims combining to create a race-focused package built for speed, reliability, and progression. Available in both 19.5\"\" and 20.5\"\" top tube lengths, the Xenon Expert XL offers riders the opportunity to find their ideal fit and maximise performance every time they line up at the gate.",
